        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 2798, Safety Omnia Solid Brass Mortise Leverset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSimple in design, this door lever will not disappoint those looking for an elegant way to improve the style of any home.  It meets ADA accessibility requirements. Built to withstand heavy use, Omnia commercial grade, UL listed, fire rated, mortise locks combine precision engineering for security and durability with attractive designs.  Available in polished brass, polished chrome, and satin chrome finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nEach set contains door levers, backplates, mortise latchset, spindle, and all necessary screws and templates. Key functions are supplied with lock cylinder/s and turnpiece as applicable. \r\n</p><p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-E08LE2_size.gif?v=1704442274\" width=\"600\" height=\"307\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Mortise Box Dimensions\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p><b>Specifications</b> for Omnia 2798 Mortise Leverset\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Doors Thickness: Optional, 1-3/4\" - 2-1/4\" Thick Doors (Contact us if doors are thicker)</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 1-1/2\", 2\", 2-1/2\"or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Solid Brass Levers and Trim</li>\r\n<li>Tough, non rusting materials used throughout. </li>\r\n<li>Mortise case is heavy wrought steel with zinc dichromate finish for corrosion resistance.</li>\r\n<li>Front: Adjustable armored steel front, with 8\" x 1-1/4\" solid brass faceplate for all lock bodies, finished to match trim.</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt: Full 1\" Throw, Solid Brass with Saw-proof Insert.</li>\r\n<li>Lock Cylinder: Standard \"C\" keyway supplied with two nickel silver keys.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/mortise-lockset-specs.pdf?v=1704262187\" target=\"new\"><b>Omnia Mortise Lockset Dimensions & Specs (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul></p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Pair:</b> Stationary both sides of door. Fixed levers, non-functioning. Used as door pulls or to match trim. </li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall / Closet):</b> Latchbolt operates by lever from either side.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bathroom / Bedroom):</b> Latchbolt operates by lever from either side. Deadbolt by turnpiece inside and emergency key outside. Turning inside lever will retract both deadbolt and latchbolt at the same time.</li>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder Entry:</b> Latchbolt operates by lever from either side except when outside trim is locked by stop-button; then opens by key outside, by lever inside. Deadbolt activated by key outside and by turnpiece inside. </li>\r\n<li><b>Double Cylinder Entry:</b>  Latchbolt operates by lever from either side except when outside trim is locked",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Simple Mortise Leverset, Omnia 1752",
                "description": "Simple in design and even easier installation, this door lever, made by Omnia, will not disappoint those looking for an elegant way to improve the style of any home. Since it is available in 14 finishes, you'll be sure to find one to match your decor. ",
